1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:22,360
We've been trained to see truth telling as complaining, independent thought as rebellious, loud talking as disruptive, politicians as saviors, billionaires as intellectuals, animals as pests, the earth as disposable, each other as strangers.

2
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:31,980
So it is no surprise that it is so difficult for so many of us to identify the revolutionaries among us and the revolution required within us.

3
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,720
Support a real one.

